url: 'https://marius-juston.github.io/MarsRecon/'
abstract: >-
  HiRISE (High Resolution Imaging Science Experiment) aboard
  the Mars Reconnaissance Orbiter produces the
  highest-resolution images of Mars available (~25 cm/pixel
  RED, ~50 cm/pixel color). This library wraps the HiRISE
  RDR ( Reduced Data Records) hosted on the NASA PDS Imaging
  Node as a GeoDataset compatible with TorchGeo's samplers
  and data loaders.
